  "described": {
    "alt_text": "A stencil airbrush painting of interlocking pebble shapes in teal and pink, with a hot pink and orange van shape glowing through the centre.",
    "description": "A square stencil airbrush painting on paper. The sheet is covered with lobed pebble shapes separated by white gaps, shaded in teal, sea green and pink gradients. Across the middle, a second layer of magenta, orange and lime has been sprayed in the silhouette of a van seen from the front, with a round pink headlight at centre and lime and orange glow around it, so the vehicle shows through the pebble pattern like a reflection or a ghost.",
    "impression": "A van dissolving into the bark pattern, or the bark pattern dissolving into a van, which is a neat trick with two stencils. The headlight glows like a sunset through leaves. It is the most surprising piece in the series because it takes a few seconds to see the vehicle.",
